#     Bit 6: 10G-KX4 (A1)
#     Bit 7: 10G-KR (A2)
#     Bit 8: 40G-KR4 (A3)
#     Bit 9: 40G-CR4 (A4)
#     Bit 10: 100G-CR10 (A5)
# The following are from 802.3bj:
#     Bit 11: 100G-KP4 (A6)
#     Bit 12: 100G-KR4 (A7)
#     Bit 13: 100G-CR4 (A8)
# The following are from 802.3by:
#     Bit 14: 25G-KR/CR-S (A8)
#     Bit 15: 25G-KR/CR (A10)
